{"speciesId":64,"names":{"fr":"Kadabra","es":"Kadabra","en":"Kadabra","ja":"ユンゲラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"It emits special alpha waves from its body that induce headaches just by being close by."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"It emits special alpha waves from its body that induce headaches just by being close by."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Many odd things happen if this POKéMON is close by. For example, it makes clocks run backwards."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It possesses strong spiritual power. The more danger it faces, the stronger its psychic power."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"If it uses its abilities, it emits special alpha waves that cause machines to malfunction."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When it closes its eyes, twice as many alpha parti­ cles come out of the surface of its body."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"KADABRA emits a peculiar alpha wave if it develops a headache. Only those people with a particularly strong psyche can hope to become a TRAINER of this POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"KADABRA holds a silver spoon in its hand. The spoon is used to amplify the alpha waves in its brain. Without the spoon, the POKéMON is said to be limited to half the usual amount of its telekinetic powers."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is rumored that a boy with psychic abilities suddenly transformed into KADABRA while he was assisting research into extrasensory powers."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It happened one morning - a boy with extrasensory powers awoke in bed transformed into KADABRA."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It emits special alpha waves from its body that induce headaches just by being close."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"If one is nearby, an eerie shadow appears on TV screens. Seeing the shadow is said to bring bad luck."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When it uses its psychic power, it emits strong ha waves that can ruin precision devices."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It possesses strong spiritual power. The more danger it faces, the stronger its psychic power."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If it uses its abilities, it emits special alpha waves that cause machines to malfunction."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il fixe sa cuillère d’argent afin de concentrer son esprit et d’émettre un maximum d’ondes alpha."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il fixe sa cuillère d’argent afin de concentrer son esprit et d’émettre un maximum d’ondes alpha."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son pouvoir psychique émet des ondes alpha qui brouillent les appareils électroniques."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando utiliza su poder psíquico, emite poderosas ondas alfa que pueden destruir dispositivos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When it uses its psychic power, it emits strong alpha waves that can ruin precision devices."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"超能力を 発揮すると 強い アルファ波を 出して 精密機械を 壊してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"En utilisant ses pouvoirs, il émet des ondes alpha et cause des distorsions électroniques."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si usa sus habilidades, emite ondas alfa especiales que hacen que las máquinas fallen."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If it uses its abilities, it emits special alpha waves that cause machines to malfunction."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"能力を 使うたびに 体から 特殊な アルファ波を 出して 機械を 狂わせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kadabra émet une onde alpha si particulière qu’elle vous donne mal à la tête. Seuls les gens avec un psychisme puissant peuvent espérer devenir Dresseur de ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kadabra emite unas ondas alfa muy particulares que provocan dolores de cabeza a los demás. Solo aquellos que tengan gran poder mental podrán optar a ser Entrenador de este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kadabra emits a peculiar alpha wave if it develops a headache. Only those people with a particularly strong psyche can hope to become a Trainer of this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頭痛を 起こす 特殊な アルファ波を 出すので 強い 精神力の 持ち主じゃ ないと ユンゲラーの トレーナーには なれない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kadabra tient une cuiller en argent dans la main. Elle est utilisée pour amplifier les ondes alpha de son cerveau. Sans elle, on raconte que ce Pokémon ne peut utiliser que la moitié de ses pouvoirs télékinétiques."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kadabra lleva siempre una cuchara de plata en la mano, que usa para amplificar las ondas alfa de su cerebro. Dicen que, sin la cuchara, sus poderes de telequinesia se reducen a la mitad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kadabra holds a silver spoon in its hand. The spoon is used to amplify the alpha waves in its brain. Without the spoon, the Pokémon is said to be limited to half the usual amount of its telekinetic powers."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"銀の スプーンは アルファ波を 高める。 スプーンが ないと いつもの 半分しか 超能力を 使えなくなると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Certains pensent que lorsqu’un enfant humain télépathe perd le contrôle de ses pouvoirs psychiques, il devient un Kadabra."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Algunos creen que Kadabra no es más que un joven que perdió el control de sus poderes psíquicos y que acabó transformándose."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"A theory exists that this Pokémon was a young boy who couldn’t control his psychic powers and ended up transformed into this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"エスパー少年が 自分の 中の サイコパワーを 抑えきれなくなり 変身して しまったとの 説も。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Lorsqu’un Kadabra se trouve à proximité d’un écran, une télé par exemple, une ombre sinistre dont la vision porte malheur traverse l’image."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Cuando Kadabra está cerca de la pantalla de algún dispositivo, en esta aparece una sombra ominosa que se dice que solo trae desdicha."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Kadabra’s presence infests televisions and monitors with creepy shadows that bring bad luck."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ユンゲラーが いるとき テレビなど 機械の モニターに 不幸を 呼ぶ 不気味な 影が 通り過ぎる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il fixe sa cuiller d’argent pour concentrer son énergie psychique avant de la libérer, mais il ne peut rien faire avec une cuiller en or."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es capaz de doblar una cuchara de plata fijando la mirada y usando sus poderes psíquicos, pero no puede hacer lo propio con una de oro."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It stares at a silver spoon to amplify its psychic powers before it lets loose. Apparently, gold spoons are no good."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"銀の スプーンを じっと 見つめ サイコパワーを 増幅し 放つ。 金の スプーンでは ダメらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son esprit est doté d’impressionnantes facultés, mais elles sont diminuées de moitié s’il n’a pas de cuiller d’argent."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sus impresionantes poderes mentales se ven reducidos a la mitad cuando no lleva consigo su cuchara de plata."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It possesses strong mental capabilities, but its psychic powers are halved when it’s not holding a silver spoon."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"強い 精神力を 持つが 銀の スプーンを 持っていないと サイコパワーが 半減してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Sa présence cause des évènements étranges, comme des horloges tournant à l’envers."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Hace que sucedan cosas extrañas cuando está cerca, como que los relojes vayan al revés."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Many odd things happen if this Pokémon is close by. For example, it makes clocks run backward."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"ユンゲラーが 近くに いると 時計が 逆回転 したり おかしなことが 起こるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Sa présence cause des évènements étranges, comme des horloges tournant à l’envers."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Hace que sucedan cosas extrañas cuando está cerca, como que los relojes vayan al revés."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Many odd things happen if this Pokémon is close by. For example, it makes clocks run backward."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"ユンゲラーが 近くに いると 時計が 逆回転 したり おかしなことが 起こるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses pouvoirs psychiques lui permettent de léviter en dormant. Il utilise alors sa queue très souple comme un oreiller."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Duerme suspendido en el aire gracias a sus poderes psíquicos. La cola, de una flexibilidad extraordinaria, hace las veces de almohada."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Using its psychic power, Kadabra levitates as it sleeps. It uses its springy tail as a pillow."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"サイコパワーで 宙に 浮いたまま 眠る。 弾力に 優れた しっぽを 枕がわりに するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Incroyablement doué en télékinésie, il concentre son énergie psychique dans l’étoile sur son front en prévision de son évolution."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"La potencia de su telequinesis es inmensa. Acumula poder psíquico en la estrella de la frente como preparativo de cara a su evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon’s telekinesis is immensely powerful. To prepare for evolution, Kadabra stores up psychic energy in the star on its forehead."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"念力の 威力は 絶大。 進化に 備えて 額の 星に サイコパワーを 蓄えている。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"There are rumors that a child with mystical powers became a Kadabra; however, this remains unverified. I suspect that the spoon Kadabra holds enhances its brain waves."}],"varieties":[{"id":64,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine"